{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"02cdd93b5d0b760ba6d248ae38c87865dc3bb85dbe98d48756d62efee595d9d2","occurred_at":"2026-11-21T14:23:12Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[99,102]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"DEPENDENCY_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"(?P<directive>Wants|Requires|Requisite|BindsTo|PartOf|Conflicts|\"\n    r\"WantedBy|RequiredBy|Also|Upholds|OnFailure|OnSuccess|Triggers|\"\n    r\"TriggersBy|Unit|Service)\\s*=\\s*(?P<value>.*)\")","reason":"The dependency regex enumerates [Unit] directives but omits `StopPropagatedFrom=` and `PropagatesStopTo=`, both systemd stop-propagation dependencies. A co-installed unit using either directive is therefore invisible to the dependency scan, so discovery can miss a path that stops a co-tenant when the fence stops `crq-tick.service`. This is an implementation omission in the existing safety scan, not a request for a new contract requirement.","target":"19b47d081722fc7e68640a8ea2ca00f5c230b38f"},"finding_id":"c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442","previous_event_id":"e9141a7d75afeab99b16e34f66c1680e918cbff3a48e6d3bba1505fa22a6104e","review_id":"b08452801c153d71823e0063057ca8526a7754e9b9085e055e498d2c928878b1"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442:0a911f7bd3d1fc4df101c76fdc589d85df691e259098f7d879c19e9a79d8e649"}